        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2605.00073">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2605.00073">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2605.00073">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
